                                                "sense_id": "7dc31760-f2ae-3344-ad70-bd68abca9741",
                                                "text": "“There were golden years for GM in China, but those are over, and they’ll never have a comeback story,” said Michael Dunne, an auto industry consultant who has been involved in Western automakers’ efforts in China since the 1990s, including GM’s entry into the market."
